          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "realizador is built on realizar \"to carry out, to make\", which is usually traced to real \"real\" and so to Latin rēs \"a thing\"."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
